Package: SHDmedian
Title: Exact Bivariate and Approximate Scatter Halfspace Medians
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Filip",
        "Bočinec",
        email = "bocinec@karlin.mff.cuni.cz",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Computes the scatter halfspace median for bivariate data
    using a point-based second-order cone formulation with angular sweeps, and
    finite-direction approximate scatter medians in arbitrary dimension
    using semidefinite programming with a fixed center.
